\caption(Two explicit192-update compact Adam fits with fit-only class weights and validation checkpoints. V2 restores paired BN moments. Fixed five-step CRF evaluation follows restoration and remains separate from native-resolution metrics.)
\alttext(Two explicit192-update compact Adam fits with fit-only class weights and validation checkpoints. V2 restores paired BN moments. Fixed five-step CRF evaluation follows restoration and remains separate from native-resolution metrics.)

V1 selects epoch11 with validation mean IoU.456045; native-resolution test
accuracy/mIoU are.861484/.523973. V2 also selects epoch11, with validation
mIoU.398519; test accuracy/mIoU are.845534/.458820. V1's validation score is
still rising in this short 12-epoch fit, while V2's has levelled off near.39
since epoch4. Both retain foreground class errors. On the separate
first-four-image32px subset,fixed CRF changes mIoU.420189->.430406 for V1
and.399033->.415209 for V2. These modest
subset gains do not replace or improve the reported96px test metric.

